SUMMARY:DNA & Dead Ends: Cracking Family Mysteries
DESCRIPTION:DNA doesn't lie! Eric Schubert will share real-life past exampl
 es from his work as a professional genealogist and forensic genetic geneal
 ogist which includes long-lost family discoveries and historic cold case b
 reakthroughs. Attendees will learn practical strategies for starting or ad
 vancing their own research\, from record paper trails to working with DNA 
 matches. This program will offer a narrative of Eric’s research journey\
 , as well as clear\, accessible guidance for beginners and those with spec
 ific genealogical questions. These tips are inspired by experience solving
  complex cases for thousands across the country! Ages 18+ Space is limited
